    {
      "id": "ec9741a9-ccbd-4b5c-a37b-142f9219b6a9",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1024,
        -432
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1280,
        "height": 1792,
        "content": "Workflow Overview\nEvent Feedback Analysis & Automated Reporting\n\nThis workflow automates the complete event feedback management process from submission to reporting.\n\nAttendee feedback submitted through an n8n Form is normalized, validated, analyzed by AI, and stored in Data Tables. Urgent issues are automatically routed for immediate attention, while all collected feedback is used to generate scheduled AI-powered event improvement reports.\n\nThe generated report is converted into a text file, emailed to the organizer, and marked as delivered to prevent duplicate notifications.\n\n\nSetup Instructions\nBefore activating this template, complete the following configuration.\n\nRequired Credentials\n\n• Google Gemini API\n\n• Gmail\n\n• Discord (optional, for High-priority notifications)\n\nRequired Data Tables\n\n• event_feedback\n\n• event_review_queue\n\n• event_report_status\n\nConfiguration\n\n• Set the report recipient email address.\n\n• Configure the Schedule Trigger execution time.\n\n• Configure Discord Server and Channel IDs if Discord notifications are required.\n\nAfter completing these steps, the workflow operates automatically with no additional manual intervention.\n\n\nWho Should Use This Template?\n\nThis template is ideal for:\n\n• Event organizers\n\n• Conference managers\n\n• University event teams\n\n• Community organizers\n\n• Workshop and seminar hosts\n\n\nKey Benefits\n\n• AI-powered feedback analysis\n\n• Automatic sentiment and priority classification\n\n• Instant Discord notifications for urgent issues\n\n• Automated event improvement reports\n\n• Automatic email delivery\n\n• Duplicate report prevention\n\nInstead of manually reviewing every response, organizers receive structured insights and actionable improvement reports automatically."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c6207c97-027e-4cab-b195-e71f71b88d59",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        704,
        -512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 816,
        "height": 624,
        "content": "Feedback Processing\nFeedback Collection & AI Analysis\n\nThis section processes every submitted feedback form.\n\nNodes in this section:\n\n• Normalize submitted form data.\n\n• Prevent duplicate submissions using Data Tables.\n\n• Validate the feedback with AI.\n\n• Analyze sentiment, category, priority, and create a concise summary.\n\n• Store the analyzed feedback for later reporting.\n\nThe resulting structured data becomes the source for automated reporting and priority-based routing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f60ea9e1-2bef-4179-8fc0-ee9628d98f08",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1584,
        -512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 816,
        "height": 608,
        "content": "Priority Routing\nPriority-Based Notification\n\nAfter AI analysis, every feedback item is classified as High, Medium, or Low priority.\n\nRouting behavior:\n\n• High → Send an immediate Discord notification for urgent attention.\n\n• Medium → Store the feedback for later review.\n\n• Low → Archive for reporting purposes.\n\nThis allows organizers to react immediately to critical issues while keeping routine feedback organized."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e2512721-7806-4bc3-82e3-a8d0ca19759a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        496,
        1104
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 624,
        "height": 576,
        "content": " Automated Report Generation\nAI Report Generation\n\nA scheduled workflow automatically generates event reports.\n\nThe workflow:\n\n• Retrieves all feedback for a selected event.\n\n• Calculates statistics such as response count and average rating.\n\n• Aggregates qualitative feedback.\n\n• Generates a professional report using Google Gemini.\n\n• Converts the report into a text file.\n\n• Emails the report to the configured recipient.\n\n• Updates the report status so the same report is not sent twice.\n\nThis provides organizers with consistent reports without manual work."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
